id: SEC-021
title: ECB block cipher mode (preserves plaintext patterns)
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .java .kt .py .cs .go .js .ts
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: AES/ECB
    message: "ECB mode preserves patterns in plaintext — complete failure of confidentiality"
  - regex: MODE_ECB
    message: "ECB cipher mode — preserves data patterns, breaks confidentiality"
  - regex: CipherMode\.ECB
    message: ".NET ECB cipher mode — use CBC or GCM instead"
fix: Use AES-GCM (authenticated encryption) or AES-CBC with HMAC. Never use ECB mode.